⚡🇮🇹🇸🇦 Italian Defense Minister Guido Crosetto reports that the Taif airbase, where Italian personnel participating in Operation "Inherent Resolve" are stationed, was attacked. 

An Italian F-2000 aircraft located in a remote area was damaged. No Italian military personnel were injured, and there is no other damage to equipment or infrastructure.

